2.0.0 (in-progress):
------------------
  * Breaking change: replaced workspace-as-source model with archive_url and
    debian_path inputs; action now downloads the upstream source archive,
    extracts it, and copies the debian/ directory from the workspace into it
  * Breaking change: default codename the package is built on is now 'trixie'
    and 'bookworm' support has been removed

1.2.0 (2026-04-16):
------------------
  * Fix running dpkg as root
  * Added lintian to the Docker image
  * Added lintian_check option to run lintian on the built package
  * Added fail_on_lintian_error option to control whether a lintian failure
    fails the action (default: true, only applies when lintian_check is true)
  * Include major version in Docker image tags (e.g. bookworm-v1) so images
    from prior major releases remain available after a version bump

1.1.1 (2025-10-23)
-------------------
  + Add support for s390x (closes #18) by @andy5995 in #19

1.1.0 (2024-12-12)
------------------
  * Added support for building trixie packages
  * Fixed passing multiple args (Thanks @ehbello)

1.0.0 (2024-03-15)
------------------
